//! Raw bindings to the EmbedPDF PDFium fork's C ABI, generated by `bindgen`
//! 0.72.1 over the same headers
//! `packages/engine/runtime/build/generate-functions.mjs` walks, with the same
//! `FPDF|EPDF|FORM|PDFiumExt_` filter.
//!
//! Group G0 (multiplatform-port-order.md). This crate is internal. Nothing
//! reaches it from Swift, Kotlin, Node or the browser: the boundary is per
//! operation, never per item, so exposing this surface would be building the
//! expensive thing on purpose.
#![allow(non_camel_case_types, non_snake_case, non_upper_case_globals, dead_code)]

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/bindings.rs"));
